WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.659
Lab 2 runs in a worldwide or G C C test
tenant with Microsoft Entra I D Governance,

2
00:00:05.659 --> 00:00:10.837
a trial will do, and for the optional
Azure step, a test Azure subscription.

3
00:00:10.837 --> 00:00:11.963
Never production.

4
00:00:11.963 --> 00:00:17.401
Pick a role with no real holders, such as
Reports Reader, not Global Administrator.

5
00:00:17.401 --> 00:00:22.150
Register a reader app and an applier
app, write a test file with one series,

6
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:26.662
dry-run as the reader, and apply after
a second person reads the bodies.

7
00:00:26.662 --> 00:00:30.700
Then close one instance as a test
reviewer, and read the evidence.

8
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:35.342
The reader gets Access Review dot Read
dot All, the applier Access Review dot

9
00:00:35.342 --> 00:00:40.500
ReadWrite dot All, and User Access Administrator
only for the optional Azure series.

10
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.972
The back-out exports the evidence first,

11
00:00:42.972 --> 00:00:47.917
then deletes the test series in the admin
center, because the code never deletes,

12
00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:51.588
along with the apps, their
certificates and the test groups.

13
00:00:51.588 --> 00:00:53.810
The authors haven't run Lab 2.
